Having lost at least 3 really great nethack 3.0 games to crashes, I was
immensely grateful for recover when my promising nethack 3.1 game developed
hiccups (there was something wrong with the mining village from a bones
level).  After about a dozen crash-and-recovers (mostly not in a row) the
village level and everything below it got regenerated, and things have been
smooth since then (and the new treasures don't hurt either).

